00:44:40.420 --> 00:44:50.559
<v ED5485B4-A3ED-4DE0-B9F4-F5EEC0ABBE0E>Codey: Um, The only other thing I like about thrips or that I'll mention about thrips is that they are one of the few examples of asymmetry within insects.

